flowchart TD
    A{Large analytical<br/>scans?} -- Yes --> B[BigQuery]
    A -- No --> C{Relational?}
    C -- Yes --> D{Global and<br/>consistent?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Spanner]
    D -- No --> F[Cloud SQL,<br/>AlloyDB if larger]
    C -- No --> G{Keyed lookup<br/>at volume?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Bigtable]
    G -- No --> I{Documents?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Firestore]
    I -- No --> K[Memorystore to cache,<br/>Cloud Storage for files]
